    "corrupt_physical_fts_cannot_obtain_a_witness_or_trigger_recovery_io"
  ],
  "required_unexecuted_gates": [
    "Actual SQLx driver adoption and both original Cargo/MODULE lock generators, including the new Memory libsqlite3-sys dev edge.",
    "Fresh catalog with exactly one selected parent; the explicitly invoked ignored support is not another passing case.",
    "Counterfactual must reach exact native checkpoint, cancel, acquire the real fence and report gate_status=0 before the intended parent assertion fails; setup or timeout failures are not causal proof.",
    "Restore exact production source; run new parent, all original Memory recovery cases and complete owning state/Memory original gates, followed by original fix/fmt.",
    "Windows remains a source-level owner-retention claim until original platform tests execute."
  ],
  "scope_limits": [
